01:17:20.426 --> 01:17:21.259
- Right.

01:17:21.259 --> 01:17:22.690
- I think throughout my YouTube career.

01:17:22.690 --> 01:17:23.628
- Really?

01:17:23.628 --> 01:17:24.461
- I think that's my problem.

01:17:24.461 --> 01:17:25.294
I think like...

01:17:25.294 --> 01:17:26.127
- I wish I could tell you how I did it.

01:17:26.127 --> 01:17:26.960
(Connor laughs)

01:17:26.960 --> 01:17:30.120
- This year, especially, I
think I've been like close

01:17:30.120 --> 01:17:32.400
to burnout around like fucking 10 times.

01:17:32.400 --> 01:17:34.170
- You've been really bad this year.

01:17:34.170 --> 01:17:35.570
- And I think it's just because this year.

01:17:35.570 --> 01:17:36.737
- Fuck you Connor.

01:17:36.737 --> 01:17:38.272
- You suck this year.

01:17:38.272 --> 01:17:39.263
- Fuck you guys.

01:17:39.263 --> 01:17:41.200
