01:17:44.444 --> 01:17:46.000
- And I think just because normally

01:17:46.000 --> 01:17:49.310
I'm used to a change of environment
or change of breath room

01:17:49.310 --> 01:17:51.490
just because of like the global situation.

01:17:51.490 --> 01:17:52.323
We've not been able to travel.

01:17:52.323 --> 01:17:53.156
- Lockdown has definitely made it worse.

01:17:53.156 --> 01:17:55.730
- Lockdown has just made
it like 10 times worse.

01:17:55.730 --> 01:17:58.960
And I know, like I've gotten
a few comments recently, like,

01:17:58.960 --> 01:18:01.875
Oh, Garnt's uploading videos
less, what's going on there?

01:18:01.875 --> 01:18:03.274
