01:19:15.433 --> 01:19:17.230
- I don't know how to switch
off though, I really don't.

01:19:17.230 --> 01:19:18.680
- I guess.

01:19:18.680 --> 01:19:22.470
Having like a little bit of
backlog of videos is like,

01:19:22.470 --> 01:19:23.925
