01:20:35.690 --> 01:20:37.452
That's coming out soon.

01:20:37.452 --> 01:20:38.550
- We did a special thing.

01:20:38.550 --> 01:20:39.383
- We did a special video.

01:20:39.383 --> 01:20:41.520
And then also we have the
podcast in between there

01:20:41.520 --> 01:20:43.190
