01:20:44.100 --> 01:20:47.960
So it's just like having
that backlog, even if,

01:20:47.960 --> 01:20:49.220
okay, this is my advice to your Garnt.

01:20:49.220 --> 01:20:52.290
Even if you have to do a
month between each upload,

01:20:52.290 --> 01:20:54.220
